  "releaseNotes": "MarkdownField: the editor now sizes itself to its content (minimum six lines) instead of a fixed number of rows, and fills the remaining height when placed in the last row of a fill-available grid or in a row with an explicit Height (internal scrolling), the same way RichTextField does. The Rows property is removed (a value saved by 0.9.0 is ignored). The preview pane scrolls inside the editor frame.",
